.TH "nvme_init_get_features_personality" 9 "nvme_init_get_features_personality" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_get_features_personality \- Initialize passthru command for Get Features - Configurable Device Personality
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_get_features_personality
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "enum nvme_get_features_sel sel "  ","
.BI "__u8 perid "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select which type of attribute to return,
see \fIenum nvme_get_features_sel\fP
.IP "perid" 12
Personality Identifier (PERID), see \fIenum
nvme_personality_identifier\fP
.IP "data" 12
Personality Identifier specific data buffer, or NULL if the
personality does not use the data buffer
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Get Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_CONF_DEV_PERSONALITY
